## memory_forget — Destructive, run with call_destructive (a person must approve it first)
Delete a fact for good, with every earlier and later version of it from corrections. Nothing of it is kept. To record that a value changed, use memory_correct instead.
arguments schema: {"type":"object","properties":{"factId":{"description":"Handle (like \u0022f12\u0022) or ID of the fact to delete, as memory_recall showed it","type":"string"},"containerId":{"description":"Optional and not needed: the fact is found by its id in every space you can see","type":["string","null"],"default":null}},"required":["factId"]}

